      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This study highlights the various parameters considered for experimenting automatic equipment correctly. By applying such parameters to experiments with the \"Sicard\" system (Siemens) for automatic ECG reading, the usefulness of the system for its declared purpose, i.e. mass screening and epidemiological research, has been demonstrated."},
